<h2>Segment 368 &mdash; four conceptions and their accuracy</h2>
<div class="pair">
<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s368S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w1">bsam pa</span> la <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w2">gsum</span> las, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w3">&#x27;du shes</span> ni <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w4">bzhi</span> ste, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w5">gzhi</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w6">sems can</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s368f1">lta bu</span> la <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w7">sems can</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p1">du</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w8">&#x27;du shes pa</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w9">sems can</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w10">min par</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w11">&#x27;du shes pa</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w12">sems can</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w13">min pa</span> la <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w14">sems can</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w15">min par</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w16">&#x27;du shes pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p2">dang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w17">sems can</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p3">du</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w18">&#x27;du shes pa</span> bzhi ste, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w19">&#x27;du shes</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w20">dang po</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p4">dang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w21">gsum pa</span> ni <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w22">ma &#x27;khrul ba</span> dang , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w23">gnyis pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p5">dang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w24">bzhi pa</span> ni <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w25">&#x27;khrul ba</span>&#x27;o,</span>
</div>
<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s368S">The part of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w1">thinking</span> has <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w2">three</span> components of its own. <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w3">Conception</span> can be of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w4">four</span> different types: to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w8">conceive</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w5">object</span>, <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s368f1">say</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w6">living being</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p1">as being</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w7">living being</span>; to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w11">conceive</span> of a living being as something <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w10">other than</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w9">living being</span>; to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w16">conceive</span> of something <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w13">other than</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w12">living being</span> as being <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w15">other than</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w14">living being</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p2">and</span> to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w18">conceive</span> of this same thing <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p3">as</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w17">living being</span>. The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w20">first</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p4">and</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w21">third</span> types of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w19">conception</span> here are <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w22">unmistaken</span>; the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w23">second</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p5">and</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w24">fourth</span> are <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w25">mistaken</span>.</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; Codex independent TIBETAN-FIRST PROVISIONAL proposal. Each of four conception cases has its own verb and complement. Negative other-than copulas remain scoped to the correct nonliving object/complement, with repeated source/English support left unbanked. Unmistaken is retained whole and contrasts with the separate mistaken predicate; no subword splitting. Source origin 1be02f91d0c7546f4997d25cafd19c976ba4db3e through363; actual through366 acceptance is a separately supplied later checkpoint, never invented.</div>
